WEBVTT

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.940
I have a copy of this, too.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.860
So Yamamoto-san also reads poetry books...

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.910
Nana, hurry up and give it!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.120
Ah, yeah!

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:48.110
Nana!

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:48.770
Yes?!

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:49.980
Are you waiting for someone?

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.110
A-Ah, nope...

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:52.280
Then let's hurry up and go already.

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.820
The lunch counter's gonna get crowded.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.820
Y-Yeah.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:55.660
I guess you're right.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.120
What am I gonna do...?

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:41.050
I'm sure Yamamoto-san's upset, since she lost the picture...

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.510
I have to get it back to her.

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:49.060
But I can't find the right time to talk to her...

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.270
And...

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.780
What? You also had a copy of it?

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:07.040
I don't understand...

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.000
...why Yamamoto-san had a picture of Yano.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.430
Ah... someone just went to throw the trash in the incinerator.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.850
Were you looking for something?

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:26.890
No...

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.020
You serious?

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.060
Hey, listen to this! You won't believe what he did!

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.270
Come on, shut up!

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:35.520
Just spill it!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.160
Nana-chan.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.960
Let me see your English homework.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:55.080
Again? You need to do it yourself sometimes, you know.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.000
Please?

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:57.750
Sheesh.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.840
All right. Thanks a lot.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:07.010
Ah, I'm... getting jealous again...

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.810
...because of that picture.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.230
Nana-chan, is something bugging you?

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:18.730
It's like you haven't been able to relax all day.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.240
N-Not really.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.410
I guess that's fine, then.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.990
But remember, no secrets between us.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.710
That's not fair... with just one smile, I'll let you do whatever you want.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.130
Go ahead and take my homework.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.840
You're gonna be called on today, right?

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.760
Really? Yay!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.470
That's why I want him all to myself...

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:52.140
Oh, now I get it!

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:58.400
That picture... wasn't of Yano. It was picture of Yamamoto-san's sister!

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:01.070
I see! It all connects now!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.400
It makes sense for Yamamoto-san to have it.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:05.910
Huh?

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.410
Did you do the English assignment?

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:10.620
I've got it down pat.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.370
Let me see it?

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:12.120
No.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.500
Nana-chan's notebook is only for me.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:28.390
That's... mine.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.860
Give it back.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:49.870
Is this some sort of harassment?!

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.430
Yano.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.230
U-Umm...

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.770
In my notebook before...

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.440
Umm...

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:26.150
W-Was there maybe.. a picture in it?

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.450
A picture of what?

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.160
Ah... never mind. If you didn't see it, don't worry about it.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.450
I gave it back.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:40.170
I gave it back to Yamamoto.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.250
Ah... I see...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.050
Umm... did Yamamoto-san say anything about it...?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.470
Not a word.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.350
Umm, nothing like "where'd you find it" or anything?

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:57.930
Nothing like that.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.190
Ah... I see...

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.230
He's...

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.480
...mad.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:06.690
Yano...

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.990
Nana-chan... why'd you have that?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.490
He's really mad at me...

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:18.500
Snooping around in other people's things is pretty awful, don't you think?

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.510
Let me see your textbook.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.600
Why are you working ten pages ahead?

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.310
There's nothing else to do at home.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.480
There's nothing else to do, so you study?

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.770
You sure are different.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:34.130
If you hate me that much, we shouldn't have even gotten to know each other to begin with.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:40.260
You only used me to get revenge on my sister, anyway.

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:43.310
"Revenge"?

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:46.270
That wouldn't mean anything, and I'd have no reason to do that.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.770
Ah... sure.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.690
No... never mind.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:54.280
On second thought...

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.150
Let me see yours, Yamamoto.

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:02.910
Thank you.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:39.320
Nana, you're not gonna buy those clothes you just tried on?

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.030
They looked so good on you, too.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.950
I'm broke.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.910
Then why did you invite me to go shopping?

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:47.750
Did you have a fight with Yano?

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.500
What's Yano doing today?

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:55.630
"Pretty awful..."

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.760
I wasn't really snooping around...

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:04.350
Yano can be really cold sometimes...

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:09.730
He hasn't called me, even though it's Sunday...

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.150
It's Yano!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:17.940
It is Yano.

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:19.610
Hello---

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:21.860
Hello? Hi there!

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.780
Nice to meet you! Are you Yano's girlfriend?

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:25.700
Huh?

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.160
I went to the same middle school as Yano.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:32.790
We're at Take's house right now.

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.590
Yano's throwing him a birthday party today.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.130
Wanna come over?

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:41.630
Ah... sure... but I'm out shopping with a friend right now...

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.090
A friend?! Is she female?!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:44.930
That sounds great! Bring her with you!

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.560
We'll make a whole hook-up party out of this!

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.060
W-What?

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.350
By the way, is your friend cute?

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.940
Hey, what are you doing with my cell?

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:53.940
Yano's voice!

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.070
Huh? I was thinking of making a hook-up party.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:56.650
Are you a moron?

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:58.070
Hello?

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:58.780
Ah, Ya--

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.150
You don't have to come.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:09.160
H-He hung up on me...

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:13.170
I... just snapped.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.420
Ah, you really came?!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.170
You son of a bitch.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.340
Have a seat, heave a seat!

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:23.260
That annoyed look was blatantly obvious.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.640
What'll you have to drink?

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.600
We have everything, since he runs a liquor store.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.310
Want some sake?

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:29.390
Just kidding, just kidding!

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.430
Moron.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.020
Why don't you sit next to Yano?

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:35.400
Ah, no... here's fine.

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:37.230
You don't have to hold back.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:38.820
Hey, Yano.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:41.490
I'm getting kinda tired. Maybe I should head back?

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.740
Ah, that little... he's ignoring me!

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.990
For being my boyfriend, he's really ruining things!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.620
Ah, that reminds me...

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:54.370
I thought coming empty-handed might seem rude, so I bought you a present, Takeuchi-kun.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.710
Huh? You don't have to.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:03.670
A-Ah, don't mention it. It's nothing special, so, umm...

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.970
Don't expect too much.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:09.060
Thanks. What could it be?

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:10.930
It's a cellphone strap.

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.820
I... I told you it wasn't anything special...

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:23.440
I... I was going for a gag gift, yeah...

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.950
Was it a bit too corny...?

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:32.290
No... I think I actually kinda like it.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:35.040
Really?! Thank goodness!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:38.040
I had a really hard time choosing, so that's great to hear!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:40.840
Cheers!

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.550
Ch-Cheers...

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:50.970
This is bad...

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:53.520
You're too transparent, Yano!

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:57.480
Ah... let's try to nonchalantly change the topic...

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.360
By the way, it's that, isn't it?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:00.770
A-Ah, yeah! It is, isn't it?

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.530
It's the season for sea urchins, right?

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:03.990
You didn't change the topic one bit!

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.910
Take! Take!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.200
Keep going with the topic change!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:11.330
Just like you always do! You're good at it!

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:12.620
Sea urchins?

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:15.370
You jealous of the sea urchin?

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.120
What are you doing?!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.330
What was that?

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.840
You're jealous, aren't you?

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:23.840
You've had such a bored look on your face this whole time.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.550
I'm not jealous at all of that weird strap.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.550
Weird?!

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:30.640
Then why don't you find a different look?

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.680
It's my birthday, you know.

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.930
I'm sympathizing with you.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.980
Getting such a lame sea urchin like that.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.060
Lame?!

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:40.440
You're just pitiful, getting so happy over it.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:43.400
What's this? You're obviously just jealous.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:46.190
Yano... be an adult about this.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.330
I can't believe you!

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.630
What the hell are you doing?!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:06.710
Throwing away someone's present like that... you're scum!

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:09.380
The world doesn't revolve around you, Yano!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.140
Think about what you did!

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.640
I'm leaving!

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.930
Wait, Takahashi!

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.520
Where's my sea urchin?

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.150
Hell if I know.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.650
Takahashi!

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.320
You don't have to take me home!

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:32.160
Wait up.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.250
You're annoying. Go away, you bastard.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:52.720
The world may not revolve around me...

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:55.970
...but you're here for me, aren't you?

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:58.470
Didn't you say that?

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:04.060
But what you just did was a mistake.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.980
You can't do that sort of stuff, Yano.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:15.120
I don't need anything that won't be mine.

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.450
Sometimes...

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:22.210
...Yano can be cold.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:29.920
Then, you don't need me...?

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.180
Really cold...

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:33.430
Don't you need me?

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:36.800
There's something wrong with you being unable to believe in people.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:41.930
Have you ever believed in someone and been betrayed by them?

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.650
Have you?

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.110
You'll never...

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.950
...understand how I feel.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.670
Yano, you're not fair.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.130
Takahashi.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.340
It's okay if you don't understand.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.350
Didn't you throw it out the window...?

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.350
I threw a peanut.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:27.610
I'm sorry. I got jealous.

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:31.110
It annoys me.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.610
I want one, too.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:34.990
But you said it was weird and lame.

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:36.410
Despite that, I want one.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.120
He didn't deny it...

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.330
Here.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:43.330
Give it to Takeuchi sometime when I'm not watching.

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:48.380
Can I ask for something else out of selfishness?

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:49.670
Yeah.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:53.090
Don't be nice to any other guys when I'm around.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:58.470
Is it okay if you're not looking?

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:03.430
Takahashi, I know you don't want to, but please.

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:05.640
Try to read between the lines here. Please.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.860
And one more thing.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:11.110
I love you.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.400
So...

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.990
...don't go anywhere.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.630
Don't go anywhere.

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:52.060
The starry sky looks just like the planetarium...

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:57.070
If a shooting star whizzed by, what would you wish for?

00:18:57.070 --> 00:19:00.240
"I wish to become rich as soon as possible."

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:03.740
Please don't talk about unrealistic dreams.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:06.750
They're just dreams.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.630
What about you?

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:11.750
Me?

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.290
I'd...

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:17.010
...wish to marry Yano.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.590
...wish to be with you forever.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.010
Oh, I like that.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:26.770
Umm... me too.

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:30.020
I'd wish to be your first and your last.

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.730
Why do you always attach that stuff to what I say?

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:39.240
And you say that pretty easily, but do you know what it really means?

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:40.990
Yeah.

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:45.830
To be together with you until you die.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:50.500
Do you swear it?

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.170
I swear it on the stars.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:58.840
If there's a shooting star, I wish to be with Nana-chan forever.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.450
Takahashi, I'm sorry!

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:27.240
I'm really, really sorry!

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:29.200
I can't seem to find the sea urchin anywhere.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:33.830
I looked for it all night, but I couldn't find it at all.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:36.630
I'm sorry.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.050
Yano only pretended to throw it out.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:46.600
I see.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:47.600
I'm sorry, too.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.520
I should've told you sooner.

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:53.560
No... I'm just glad I didn't lose it.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:21:00.440
Ah, but I won't put it on my cellphone.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:02.490
He'd probably get the wrong idea if I did.

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.320
I-I'm really sorry about this, and for making you have to do that...

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:07.410
Bye!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:12.290
Takeuchi-kun is... Takeuchi-kun is...

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:14.920
My heart's squeezing in delight?

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.670
Not that!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:20.170
Did you say something?

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:22.170
Nope, not a thing...

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:26.680
It'd be nice if Yano tried taking some pointers from Takeuchi-kun...

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:30.100
By the way, Yano...

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:33.680
...when you keep flirting like this, it's hard to study.

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:37.400
You're kind of like my boy cousin.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:44.150
He's only five, but he always gets in my shirt and hugs me.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:45.400
Perverted little runt.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:47.660
It's not like that. He just want to touch me.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:49.910
When I carry him around, he gets really happy.

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:52.200
And he's only happy if a girl does it.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:55.410
Even though the three-year-old girl doesn't do that at all...

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:02.920
Yano?

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:05.420
So I'm the same as a five-year-old brat?

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:08.430
I wonder If I hurt his pride?

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:11.680
There's nothing to worry about. It's just me here.

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:13.980
I'll give you a hug, so why don't you come on over?

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:19.400
As I thought, he really is the same as a five-year-old.

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:22.650
Motoharu.

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:23.730
Yes?

00:22:23.730 --> 00:22:26.150
Some girl from school is waiting outside for you.

00:22:31.490 --> 00:22:33.040
I wonder if she's here to confess her love?

00:22:33.040 --> 00:22:34.580
That kind of pisses me off...

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:36.160
And it kinda looks like he's used to this!

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:37.870
I'll be back in a minute!

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:38.960
Yes, yes.

